---
import ExternalBrandMark from '../common/ExternalBrandMark';
import { localePath, type Locale } from '../../i18n';

interface Props { locale?: Locale; }
const { locale='zh' } = Astro.props;
const t=(zh:string,en:string)=>locale==='zh'?zh:en;
const p=(path:string)=>localePath(locale,path);
const experimentRevision='e9b734c64f663d8577d3d89a42851657691e021e';
const harness2Revision='787b862e7957af80e7b1890616a7dc5757ac0316';
const repo='https://github.com/mykcs/openevo-experiment/blob';

const genealogy=[
  {
    n:'01', tag:'任务种类', id:'H1.38A-C',
    title:t('成功经验来自多少种不同任务，会影响训练效果吗？','Does the number of distinct successful tasks affect training?'),
    body:t('我们先让模型自然做题：148 次尝试里得到 50 条可以用于训练的完整成功轨迹，来自 18 个不同任务，其中 14 个任务至少成功过两次。随后把训练数据固定为 16 条，只改变这 16 条来自 4、8 还是 16 个不同任务。','We first let the model solve tasks naturally: 148 attempts produced 50 trainable exact-success traces from 18 distinct tasks, and 14 tasks succeeded at least twice. We then fixed the training set at 16 records and changed only whether those records came from 4, 8, or 16 distinct tasks.'),
    result:t('结果没有显示“任务种类越多就一定越好”。三种设置的提升幅度不单调，而且统计区间都跨过 0，所以这里最多只能说：8 个任务是一种方便的小样本结构，不是已经证明的最佳门槛。','The result did not show that more task diversity was always better. The three settings were non-monotonic and all intervals crossed zero, so eight tasks was at most a convenient small-sample structure, not a proven optimal threshold.'),
    href:`${repo}/${experimentRevision}/docs/reports/OPEN_EVO_WEBSHOP_PROGRAM_REPORT_2026-08-20.md`,
  },
  {
    n:'02', tag:'训练方法对照', id:'H1.38B',
    title:t('比较普通 LoRA 和 SD-LoRA 时，我们故意让两边吃同一份 16 条成功数据','For the LoRA vs SD-LoRA comparison, both methods deliberately used the same 16 successful records'),
    body:t('为了只比较训练方法，我们固定了 16 条学生自己产生的成功轨迹：8 个不同任务，每个任务各有 2 条独立成功。这样两种方法看到的数据完全相同，比较才干净。','To isolate the training method, we fixed 16 student-generated successful traces: eight distinct tasks with two independent successes each. Both methods therefore saw exactly the same data.'),
    result:t('这里的“8 个任务 × 每个 2 条成功”只是为了构造一份方便比较的 16 条训练集，并不是说以后每次训练都必须先满足这个条件。','The “8 tasks × 2 successes” structure existed only to make a clean 16-record comparison set. It did not mean every future training update had to satisfy the same condition.'),
    href:`${repo}/${experimentRevision}/configs/experiment/h1.38b-method-control-v1.json`,
  },
  {
    n:'03', tag:'一次性采样实验', id:'H1.40',
    title:t('下一代模型能不能在有限预算里自己攒出一份新训练集？','Can the next generation build a new training set within a bounded budget?'),
    body:t('这个小实验最多允许 256 次任务尝试。只有当至少 8 个不同任务都各自得到 2 条可训练成功轨迹时，我们才有足够材料拼出下一份 16 条训练集；否则这次小实验就在这里结束。','This small study allowed at most 256 task attempts. We could build the next 16-record training set only if at least eight distinct tasks each produced two trainable successes; otherwise the bounded study ended there.'),
    result:t('因此这里的 256 是一次小实验的预算上限，8×2 是“够不够凑出 16 条训练数据”的判断。它仍然不是长期 Stage 2 的更新规则。','Here 256 was only the budget cap for one bounded study, while 8×2 asked whether 16 training records could be assembled. It was still not a long-running Stage-2 update rule.'),
    href:`${repo}/${experimentRevision}/configs/experiment/h1.40-g2-multigeneration-v1.json`,
  },
  {
    n:'04', tag:'错误推广到长期训练', id:'H1.45 / H1.46',
    title:t('真正出错的是这一步：把小实验的停止条件搬进了长期 Stage 2','The actual mistake: a bounded-study stopping rule was carried into long-running Stage 2'),
    body:t('长预算实验把 20,480 次任务切成 80 批，每批 256 次；每一批都重新要求“8 个不同任务 × 每个成功 2 次”。这一批不够 8 个就完全不训练，而且上一批的成功也不能带过来。','The long-budget run split 20,480 attempts into 80 batches of 256 and re-applied “8 distinct tasks × 2 successes each” inside every batch. A batch below eight received no training update, and successes from the previous batch could not carry over.'),
    result:t('所以设计错误不是“8、2、256 这些数字看起来太大或太小”，而是把本来只服务于一次小实验的条件，变成长期训练每一批都必须重新通过的门。','The design error was not that 8, 2, or 256 were inherently too large or too small. The mistake was turning a condition meant for one bounded study into a gate that every batch of long-running training had to pass again.'),
    href:p('/research/seed-openevo/study/capability-exploration/stage2-256-window/'),
  },
];

const prefixRows=[
  { model:'3B', oldExact:'7', oldInvalid:'130 / 1,280 · 10.2%', oldScore:'0.0149', nextExact:'0', nextInvalid:'481 / 1,280 · 37.6%', nextScore:'0.00145' },
  { model:'7B', oldExact:'68', oldInvalid:'171 / 1,280 · 13.4%', oldScore:'0.2918', nextExact:'17', nextInvalid:'322 / 1,280 · 25.2%', nextScore:'0.0974' },
];

const diagnostics=[
  {
    tag:'旧动作过滤 · H1.20',
    question:t('是不是历史经验里写着“现在不能点的按钮”，把模型带偏了？','Were stale UI actions inside memory steering the model wrong?'),
    change:t('我们比较基础模型、原始 Text Memory、以及“只保留当前页面确实允许的动作”的 Text Memory。唯一改变的是：历史经验里如果出现当前页面不能执行的动作，就把那条动作隐藏；不会替模型偷偷选另一个动作。','We compared base, raw Text Memory, and a version that hides historical actions unavailable on the current page. The only change was removing those stale actions; the system never substituted a different action for the model.'),
    observation:t('96 次任务都正常跑完。过滤确实挡掉了 480 条历史动作里的 128 条不可执行建议，但三组平均得分仍然都是 0，也没有产生可以用于训练的完整成功轨迹。','All 96 attempts completed normally. Filtering removed 128 of 480 historical action suggestions that were unavailable in the current page, but all three groups still had mean score 0 and produced no trainable exact-success traces.'),
    meaning:t('所以“只把旧按钮建议藏掉”还不够。这个实验说明过滤动作本身确实生效，但没有证明它能恢复做题能力。','So merely hiding stale button suggestions was not enough. The filter worked mechanically, but it did not restore task performance.') ,
    href:`${repo}/${experimentRevision}/configs/experiment/h1.20-action-admissibility-diagnostic.json`,
  },
  {
    tag:'步数上限 · H1.21',
    question:t('会不会只是每题最多 15 步太短，模型还没来得及买到东西？','Was the 15-step limit simply too short?'),
    change:t('保持上一组实验完全相同，只把每题最多 15 步提高到 30 步。这样可以单独检查“多给时间”能不能解决问题。','We kept the previous comparison unchanged and only raised the per-task limit from 15 to 30 steps, isolating whether more interaction time would help.'),
    observation:t('历史动作过滤又挡掉了 960 条建议里的 164 条不可执行动作，但三组仍然没有一次完整购买，也没有可用于训练的完整成功轨迹，平均得分仍为 0。','The filter removed 164 of 960 unavailable historical action suggestions, but all three groups still produced zero complete purchases, zero trainable exact-success traces, and mean score 0.'),
    meaning:t('所以问题也不能简单归因于“步数太短”。', 'So the failure could not be explained simply by the task horizon being too short.'),
    href:`${repo}/${experimentRevision}/configs/experiment/h1.21-horizon-matched-action-admissibility-diagnostic.json`,
  },
  {
    tag:'相同任务位置对比 · 2026-08-31',
    question:t('Ceiling-1.0 变差，会不会只是因为碰巧遇到了更难的任务？','Could Ceiling-1.0 look worse simply because it happened to see harder tasks?'),
    change:t('不再额外跑 GPU。我们直接从已有轨迹里取相同训练顺序位置的前 1,280 次任务，分别比较 3B 和 7B 在旧版本与 Ceiling-1.0 下的表现，并确认动作解析规则没有换。','We used no extra GPU run. Instead, we compared the same first 1,280 schedule positions from existing trajectories for both 3B and 7B, while confirming that the action parser contract had not changed.'),
    observation:t('3B 的完整成功从 7 次降到 0 次，因非法动作提前结束的比例从 10.2% 升到 37.6%；7B 的完整成功从 68 次降到 17 次，非法动作比例从 13.4% 升到 25.2%。','3B dropped from seven exact successes to zero while invalid-action terminations rose from 10.2% to 37.6%; 7B dropped from 68 exact successes to 17 while invalid-action terminations rose from 13.4% to 25.2%.'),
    meaning:t('所以不能简单说“3B 本来就做不了这些题”。换到新的经验注入方式后，两个模型都更容易在动作接口上出问题；只是 7B 还保留了一些成功，3B 更容易直接跌到完全没有成功种子的状态。','So this cannot be explained as “3B simply cannot solve these tasks.” Both model sizes became more fragile at the action interface under the newer experience-injection path; 7B still retained some successes, while 3B was more likely to fall all the way to zero success seeds.'),
    href:p('/research/seed-openevo/study/capability-exploration/openevo-2-0/'),
  },
  {
    tag:'Harness 2.0 正式实验前检查 · 128 + 128',
    question:t('把经验提示变薄、分清职责以后，3B 的动作接口能不能先恢复正常？','If experience prompts become thinner and role-separated, can 3B recover a healthy action interface?'),
    change:t('正式重跑 Stage 2 之前，先复用 3B 已经做过的 16 个任务，跑两个各 128 次的小测试。两组使用完全相同的 Stage 1 参数、任务、随机种子、采样温度和动作解析规则；唯一差别是一组完全不放历史经验提示，另一组只放经过接口安全约束的历史经验。','Before rerunning formal Stage 2, reuse 16 tasks that 3B has already seen and run two fixed 128-attempt cells. Both use the same Stage-1 parameters, tasks, seeds, temperature, and parser; the only difference is no historical carrier text versus an interface-safe carrier.') ,
    observation:t('这一步首先检查的不是分数高低，而是更基础的事情：经验文本有没有越权告诉模型具体按钮、上下文有没有塞爆、输出格式是否稳定、模型有没有继续大量选择当前页面根本不存在的动作、运行时是否真的读到了我们以为注入的内容。两组各固定 128 次，不因为中间分数好看或难看临时扩样。','The primary checks are not headline scores. They ask whether experience text over-specifies UI actions, whether context overflows, whether formatting stays stable, whether the model still chooses actions unavailable on the current page, and whether runtime readback proves the intended context was actually injected. Each cell stays fixed at 128 attempts regardless of intermediate scores.') ,
    meaning:t('目的很简单：在再花 20,480 次正式任务预算之前，先证明新的 Harness 2.0 至少没有把“模型怎么和 WebShop 说话”这件事弄坏。分数和成功数只作为诊断，不拿来事后挑规则。','The goal is simple: before spending another 20,480 formal attempts, prove that Harness 2.0 does not break how the model talks to WebShop. Reward and success counts are diagnostic only and are not used to choose rules after the fact.'),
    href:`${repo}/${harness2Revision}/configs/experiment/designs/openevo-ceiling-1.0-harness2-preformal-v1.json`,
  },
];
---

<section class="legacy-journey" data-testid="legacy-stage2-research-journey">
  <header class="legacy-journey__intro">
    <p>{t('规则是怎么一步步走偏的','HOW THE RULE DRIFTED')}</p>
    <h2>{t('“8 个任务 × 每个成功 2 次 × 256 次尝试”原本不是长期训练规则','“8 tasks × 2 successes × 256 attempts” was not originally a long-running training rule')}</h2>
    <span>{t('这三个数字最早分别服务于小规模对照实验和一次性采样：我们想固定一份 16 条训练数据，或者限定一次最多采多少经验。后来我们把这些局部条件拼在一起，错误地要求长期 Stage 2 每做 256 次任务就重新满足一次，于是成功经验不断被批次边界切断。', 'These numbers originally served bounded comparisons and one-shot harvesting: fixing a 16-record training set or limiting how much one small study could collect. Later they were combined into a recurring Stage-2 requirement, so successful experience kept being cut off by batch boundaries.')}</span>
  </header>

  <div class="legacy-journey__timeline">
    {genealogy.map((item)=><article>
      <div class="legacy-journey__index"><span>{item.n}</span><small>{item.tag}</small></div>
      <div class="legacy-journey__copy">
        <h3>{item.title}</h3>
        <p>{item.body}</p>
        <strong>{item.result}</strong>
        <a href={item.href} target={item.href.startsWith('http')?'_blank':undefined} rel={item.href.startsWith('http')?'noreferrer':undefined}><ExternalBrandMark href={item.href} />{item.id} · {t('查看原始依据 →','source evidence →')}</a>
      </div>
    </article>)}
  </div>

  <aside class="legacy-journey__number-note">
    <strong>{t('这里还出现过另一个“256”，但它和这次错误不是一回事','Another “256” exists here, but it means something different')}</strong>
    <p>{t('OpenEVO 自己的 SD-LoRA 配置里也有 max_records=256，它只表示“一次训练最多保留 256 条训练记录”。我们出错的规则则是“每做 256 次 WebShop 任务，就把是否允许学习重新判断一次”。两个地方恰好用了同一个数字，但含义完全不同。', 'OpenEVO SD-LoRA also has max_records=256, which only caps how many training records one generation retains. Our mistaken rule instead re-decided permission to learn after every 256 WebShop attempts. The number is the same; the meaning is not.')}</p>
  </aside>

  <section class="legacy-journey__compare" aria-labelledby="legacy-prefix-title">
    <div>
      <p>{t('同一批任务的早期对比','EARLY MATCHED COMPARISON')}</p>
      <h2 id="legacy-prefix-title">{t('换到后来的 Ceiling-1.0 后，3B 和 7B 在前 1,280 次任务里都明显变差', 'After moving to Ceiling-1.0, both 3B and 7B degraded over the first 1,280 matched attempts')}</h2>
      <span>{t('为了排除“只是碰巧抽到了更难的题”，我们事后拿相同训练顺序位置的前 1,280 次任务做对照：旧版本取前 5 批 × 256 次，Ceiling-1.0 取前 10 轮 × 128 次。这个对比不是原先预先登记的正式因果实验，只用来判断早期退化是不是也出现在相同任务位置上。', 'To rule out the simple explanation that the newer run merely saw harder tasks, we later compared the same first 1,280 schedule positions: five 256-attempt batches from the old run and ten 128-attempt rounds from Ceiling-1.0. This was not a preregistered causal experiment; it only checks whether early degradation also appears at matched task positions.')}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="legacy-journey__table-wrap" tabindex="0" aria-label={t('3B 和 7B 的前 1280 条轨迹对比','3B and 7B first-1280 trajectory comparison')}>
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th rowspan="2">{t('模型','Model')}</th><th colspan="3">{t('旧 256-window Stage 2','Old 256-window Stage 2')}</th><th colspan="3">Ceiling-1.0</th></tr><tr><th>{t('完整成功','Exact')}</th><th>{t('非法动作提前结束','Invalid action')}</th><th>{t('平均得分','Mean score')}</th><th>{t('完整成功','Exact')}</th><th>{t('非法动作提前结束','Invalid action')}</th><th>{t('平均得分','Mean score')}</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>{prefixRows.map((row)=><tr><th>{row.model}</th><td>{row.oldExact}</td><td>{row.oldInvalid}</td><td>{row.oldScore}</td><td>{row.nextExact}</td><td>{row.nextInvalid}</td><td>{row.nextScore}</td></tr>)}</tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="legacy-journey__boundary">{t('这不是“只改一个变量”的严格因果实验，因为旧版本和 Ceiling-1.0 同时改了采样温度、Stage 1 参数初始化、经验文本注入方式和更新逻辑。它只能支持一个更窄的结论：这 1,280 个任务位置并不是 3B 天生完全做不了，而且换到新方案后，7B 的早期表现也一起下降。因此“只是新方案碰巧抽到了更难的任务位置”不足以解释全部退化；但这个事后对比不能在其余变量中继续排名谁最可能是根因，只能为后续直接控制 Harness / interface 的实验提供动机。', 'This is not a strict one-variable causal experiment because the old run and Ceiling-1.0 changed temperature, Stage-1 initialization, experience injection, and update logic together. It supports a narrower conclusion: the matched task positions were not inherently impossible for 3B, and 7B also degraded after the switch. The explanation that the new run merely encountered harder schedule positions is therefore insufficient, but this post-hoc comparison cannot rank the remaining variables by causal likelihood; it only motivates a later direct Harness/interface control.')}</p>
  </section>

  <section class="legacy-journey__diagnostics" aria-labelledby="legacy-diag-title">
    <header><p>{t('后来怎么排查','FOLLOW-UP DIAGNOSTICS')}</p><h2 id="legacy-diag-title">{t('看到旧 Stage 2 和 Ceiling-1.0 都有问题后，我们分别排查了哪些可能原因','What we tested after both the old Stage 2 and Ceiling-1.0 showed problems')}</h2><span>{t('这些小实验不是同时做的。较早的实验检查“历史经验里的旧动作”和“步数太短”是不是问题；后来看到 Ceiling-1.0 的 3B 表现明显恶化后，我们又比较了同一批任务的早期表现，并设计 Harness 2.0 的 128+128 正式实验前资格检查。', 'These diagnostics were not run at the same time. Earlier studies tested whether stale actions or a short horizon caused failures. After Ceiling-1.0 showed much worse 3B behavior, we compared matched early tasks and designed the 128+128 Harness 2.0 preformal qualification.')}</span></header>
    <div class="legacy-journey__diag-grid">
      {diagnostics.map((d)=><article>
        <small>{d.tag}</small>
        <h3>{d.question}</h3>
        <dl><div><dt>{t('只改什么','Intervention')}</dt><dd>{d.change}</dd></div><div><dt>{t('看到什么','Observation')}</dt><dd>{d.observation}</dd></div><div><dt>{t('说明什么','Meaning')}</dt><dd>{d.meaning}</dd></div></dl>
        <a href={d.href} target={d.href.startsWith('http')?'_blank':undefined} rel={d.href.startsWith('http')?'noreferrer':undefined}><ExternalBrandMark href={d.href} />{t('查看依据 →','source →')}</a>
      </article>)}
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer class="legacy-journey__next">
    <div><small>{t('后来的改法','WHAT CHANGED NEXT')}</small><strong>{t('Ceiling-1.0 去掉旧 7/8 门槛；OpenEVO 2.0 再处理 multi-carrier harness。','Ceiling-1.0 removed the old 7/8 gate; OpenEVO 2.0 then addresses the multi-carrier harness.')}</strong></div>
    <nav><a href={p('/research/seed-openevo/study/capability-exploration/stage2-ceiling/')}>{t('Ceiling-1.0 →','Ceiling-1.0 →')}</a><a href={p('/research/seed-openevo/study/capability-exploration/openevo-2-0/')}>OpenEVO 2.0 →</a></nav>
  </footer>
</section>

<style>
.legacy-journey{display:grid;gap:1.25rem;margin:1.2rem 0 1.4rem}.legacy-journey__intro,.legacy-journey__compare,.legacy-journey__diagnostics{padding:1.05rem;border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:16px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-text) 1.8%,transparent)}
.legacy-journey__intro>p,.legacy-journey__compare>div:first-child>p,.legacy-journey__diagnostics>header>p{margin:0 0 .35rem;color:var(--color-accent);font:800 .62rem/1.3 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:.08em}.legacy-journey h2{margin:0;font-size:clamp(1.15rem,2vw,1.55rem);letter-spacing:-.025em}.legacy-journey__intro>span,.legacy-journey__compare>div:first-child>span,.legacy-journey__diagnostics>header>span{display:block;margin-top:.5rem;max-width:900px;color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:.82rem;line-height:1.65}
.legacy-journey__timeline{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.65rem}.legacy-journey__timeline article{position:relative;min-width:0;padding:.9rem;border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:14px;background:var(--color-bg)}.legacy-journey__timeline article:not(:last-child)::after{content:'→';position:absolute;top:1rem;right:-.53rem;z-index:2;color:var(--color-accent);font-weight:850;background:var(--color-bg)}.legacy-journey__index{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:.5rem;align-items:center}.legacy-journey__index span{color:var(--color-accent);font:850 .7rem ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace}.legacy-journey__index small{color:var(--color-text-muted);font:750 .55rem ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:.06em}.legacy-journey__copy h3{margin:.65rem 0 .4rem;font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.35}.legacy-journey__copy p{margin:0;color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:.72rem;line-height:1.58}.legacy-journey__copy strong{display:block;margin-top:.65rem;font-size:.72rem;line-height:1.58}.legacy-journey__copy a,.legacy-journey__diag-grid a{display:inline-block;margin-top:.65rem;color:var(--color-accent);font-size:.62rem;font-weight:760;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-accent) 35%,transparent)}
.legacy-journey__number-note{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(180px,.55fr) minmax(0,1.8fr);gap:1rem;padding:.85rem 1rem;border-left:3px solid var(--color-accent);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-accent) 5%,transparent)}.legacy-journey__number-note strong{font-size:.82rem}.legacy-journey__number-note p{margin:0;color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:.74rem;line-height:1.6}
